    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "setup_py", "x": 1210, "y": 360, "width": 410, "height": 180,
      "strokeColor": "#6d28d9", "backgroundColor": "#ddd6fe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20016,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20116, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["entry_group"],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "setup_py_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arrow_backend_setup", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_setup_python", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_setup_cmake", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_setup_cargo", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_setup_precompiled", "type": "arrow"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "setup_py_text", "x": 1235, "y": 375, "width": 360, "height": 150,
      "text": "setup.py · dynamic build graph\n\nload vllm/envs.py + tools/build_rust.py\nby path; detect VLLM_TARGET_DEVICE\nget_vllm_version() / get_requirements()\nassemble CMakeExtension[] / RustExtension[]\nchoose build_ext / build_rust command classes\nsetup(...) = Python distribution\naggregation point", "originalText": "setup.py · dynamic build graph\n\nload vllm/envs.py + tools/build_rust.py\nby path; detect VLLM_TARGET_DEVICE\nget_vllm_version() / get_requirements()\nassemble CMakeExtension[] / RustExtension[]\nchoose build_ext / build_rust command classes\nsetup(...) = Python distribution\naggregation point",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20017,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20117, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["entry_group"],
      "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "setup_py", "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "setup_inputs_note", "x": 1710, "y": 370, "width": 560, "height": 150,
      "text": "Packaging inputs read by setup.py\n\n• requirements/common.txt + cuda/rocm/cpu/... runtime files\n• setuptools-scm → version + device/precompiled suffix\n• PyTorch variant + host platform + explicit env\n• package_data / console script / entry points\n\nBuild/test/docs/lint requirement files do not all become install_requires.", "originalText": "Packaging inputs read by setup.py\n\n• requirements/common.txt + cuda/rocm/cpu/... runtime files\n• setuptools-scm → version + device/precompiled suffix\n• PyTorch variant + host platform + explicit env\n• package_data / console script / entry points\n\nBuild/test/docs/lint requirement files do not all become install_requires.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20018,
