    {
      "type": "text", "id": "python_package_text", "x": 115, "y": 800, "width": 290, "height": 390,
      "text": "setuptools package discovery\n\nvllm/**/*.py\nPython APIs / Engine / Scheduler\nWorker / ModelRunner / wrappers\nPython custom-op wrappers\n\nproject metadata\nversion from setuptools-scm\nrequires-python / dependencies\nconsole script: vllm\nplugin entry points\n\nget_requirements()\ncommon + selected cuda/rocm/cpu/...\n→ install_requires\n\npackage_data\nconfigs · headers · static assets\nlibs · vendored/JIT source packages\n\nNo compiler needed\nfor this lane itself", "originalText": "setuptools package discovery\n\nvllm/**/*.py\nPython APIs / Engine / Scheduler\nWorker / ModelRunner / wrappers\nPython custom-op wrappers\n\nproject metadata\nversion from setuptools-scm\nrequires-python / dependencies\nconsole script: vllm\nplugin entry points\n\nget_requirements()\ncommon + selected cuda/rocm/cpu/...\n→ install_requires\n\npackage_data\nconfigs · headers · static assets\nlibs · vendored/JIT source packages\n\nNo compiler needed\nfor this lane itself",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 30011,
