      "text": "CUDA / NVCC\n_C_stable_libtorch\n_moe_C_stable_libtorch\ncumem_allocator + optional targets\nFlashAttention / FlashMLA / DeepGEMM\nTriton / CuTe DSL copy/JIT packages", "originalText": "CUDA / NVCC\n_C_stable_libtorch\n_moe_C_stable_libtorch\ncumem_allocator + optional targets\nFlashAttention / FlashMLA / DeepGEMM\nTriton / CuTe DSL copy/JIT packages",
