      "text": "CPU / CXX\nOpenMP / NUMA / ISA detection\nx86 variants:\n_C (AVX512 BF16/VNNI/AMX)\n_C_AVX512\n_C_AVX2 fallback\nnon-x86 → one _C", "originalText": "CPU / CXX\nOpenMP / NUMA / ISA detection\nx86 variants:\n_C (AVX512 BF16/VNNI/AMX)\n_C_AVX512\n_C_AVX2 fallback\nnon-x86 → one _C",
