      "text": "define_extension_target(name, language, sources, arches, ABI, libs)\n↓\ncmake --build --target=<selected names>\ncmake --install --component=<same target>\n↓\nsetuptools extension output directory", "originalText": "define_extension_target(name, language, sources, arches, ABI, libs)\n↓\ncmake --build --target=<selected names>\ncmake --install --component=<same target>\n↓\nsetuptools extension output directory",
