      "text": "rust-toolchain.toml\nrust/Cargo.toml workspace + Cargo.lock\n\ncmd crate → [[bin]] vllm-rs\nparser/python crate → cdylib + PyO3", "originalText": "rust-toolchain.toml\nrust/Cargo.toml workspace + Cargo.lock\n\ncmd crate → [[bin]] vllm-rs\nparser/python crate → cdylib + PyO3",
