    {
      "type": "text", "id": "wheel_staging_text", "x": 530, "y": 1481, "width": 1250, "height": 127,
      "text": "setuptools setup(...) / wheel staging directory\n\nPython package                       CMake outputs                         Cargo outputs\nvllm/**/*.py                         _C*.so / _rocm_C / allocator         vllm/vllm-rs (executable)\nAPI + Engine + wrappers              stable-libtorch / MoE / optional     _rust_tool_parser*.so (PyO3)\n\npackage_data / vendored/JIT source / configs / headers / libs / static assets\ndistribution metadata: version · install_requires · console script · plugin entry points\n\nsource build：local toolchains produce artifacts  ·  precompiled build：extracted artifacts join current Python source", "originalText": "setuptools setup(...) / wheel staging directory\n\nPython package                       CMake outputs                         Cargo outputs\nvllm/**/*.py                         _C*.so / _rocm_C / allocator         vllm/vllm-rs (executable)\nAPI + Engine + wrappers              stable-libtorch / MoE / optional     _rust_tool_parser*.so (PyO3)\n\npackage_data / vendored/JIT source / configs / headers / libs / static assets\ndistribution metadata: version · install_requires · console script · plugin entry points\n\nsource build：local toolchains produce artifacts  ·  precompiled build：extracted artifacts join current Python source",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 40011,
