    {
      "type": "text", "id": "wheel_abi_note", "x": 95, "y": 1480, "width": 340, "height": 130,
      "text": "Compatibility still matters\n\nPython ABI / abi3 vs free-threaded\nPyTorch stable C shim target floor\nCUDA/ROCm driver + runtime + arches\nsource wrapper/schema/protocol consistency\n\n“download succeeded” ≠ ABI proof", "originalText": "Compatibility still matters\n\nPython ABI / abi3 vs free-threaded\nPyTorch stable C shim target floor\nCUDA/ROCm driver + runtime + arches\nsource wrapper/schema/protocol consistency\n\n“download succeeded” ≠ ABI proof",
