    {
      "type": "text", "id": "mapping_evidence_text", "x": 110, "y": 1818, "width": 1190, "height": 220,
      "text": "setup.py: CMakeExtension logical name\n       = CMake target name\n       = cmake --install component name\n       → setuptools package destination / import name\n\nshared library filename ≠ torch operator namespace\nvllm/_C_stable_libtorch*.so --import/init--> STABLE_TORCH_LIBRARY_FRAGMENT(_C, ops)\n                                           → torch.ops._C.<op>\n\nCargo artifacts are different kinds:\nvllm/vllm-rs = Binding.Exec executable    ·    _rust_tool_parser*.so = Binding.PyO3 import module", "originalText": "setup.py: CMakeExtension logical name\n       = CMake target name\n       = cmake --install component name\n       → setuptools package destination / import name\n\nshared library filename ≠ torch operator namespace\nvllm/_C_stable_libtorch*.so --import/init--> STABLE_TORCH_LIBRARY_FRAGMENT(_C, ops)\n                                           → torch.ops._C.<op>\n\nCargo artifacts are different kinds:\nvllm/vllm-rs = Binding.Exec executable    ·    _rust_tool_parser*.so = Binding.PyO3 import module",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 40032,
