    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "ci_validation_note", "x": 1380, "y": 1790, "width": 950, "height": 270,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#93c5fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 40033,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 40133, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["evidence_group"],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "ci_validation_note_text", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ci_validation_note_text", "x": 1425, "y": 1818, "width": 860, "height": 225,
      "text": "Docker / CI expands the same graph into a variant matrix\nCUDA version × x86_64/aarch64 · CPU · macOS · ROCm recipes\ncsrc wheel can act as an internal native artifact cache before final source aggregation\n\nEvidence ladder（cannot substitute for one another）\n1. build succeeds      → compiler/linker accepted inputs\n2. import succeeds     → loader + registration work\n3. correctness test    → op/model behavior is correct\n4. benchmark           → performance impact\n\nReview target changes against every affected architecture/ABI matrix, not one local build.", "originalText": "Docker / CI expands the same graph into a variant matrix\nCUDA version × x86_64/aarch64 · CPU · macOS · ROCm recipes\ncsrc wheel can act as an internal native artifact cache before final source aggregation\n\nEvidence ladder（cannot substitute for one another）\n1. build succeeds      → compiler/linker accepted inputs\n2. import succeeds     → loader + registration work\n3. correctness test    → op/model behavior is correct\n4. benchmark           → performance impact\n\nReview target changes against every affected architecture/ABI matrix, not one local build.",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 40034,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 40134, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["evidence_group"],
      "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "ci_validation_note", "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
